cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Epidemiological suite"
abstract: >-
  Sample size, power and analysis tools for community medicine, epidemiology and clinical research: calculators for about
  160 study designs, each with its formula, a worked example and a citable source. Available as a web application and as
  the R package epidemiologicasuite.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Maheshwari
    given-names: Mukul
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/SpaRroW410/Sample_size_all"
url: "https://sparrow410.github.io/Sample_size_all/"
keywords:
  - sample size
  - power analysis
  - epidemiology
  - study design
  - R package
  - Shiny
